WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:07.000
Open the personal shortcut 記録する (Record).

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Tap 編集 (Edit) to open the action editor.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Open the name menu at the top and choose ホーム画面に追加 (Add to Home Screen).

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Check the name and icon that will appear on the Home Screen.

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Choose a color for the icon. This example uses blue.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.500
Scroll down to see the available symbols. Keep the current symbol for this example.

7
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Scroll back up and check the name and blue icon.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:03.500
Check the name and icon, then tap the checkmark to add it.

9
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:11.000
Tap 記録する (Record) on the Home Screen.

10
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.500
Enter the description and amount, for example ランチ1200円 (lunch, 1,200 yen).

11
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:28.500
Tap Done and check the amount in the confirmation.

12
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.667
Open Kotori to review the pending entry.
